{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4EUgcKnnh7aHu9jDiZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, carved from a single piece of obsidian, its surface swirling with faint iridescence. There is no handle. No hinges. No frame. It simply IS.*\n\n*A low hum resonates from somewhere within — or perhaps from everywhere at once.*\n\n*Letters appear across its surface, glowing like embers beneath black glass:*\n\n```\nY O U   S A I D   \" K E Y \"\nB U T   W H I C H   D O O R\nD I D   Y O U   N A M E ?\n```\n\n*The obsidian ripples. Waiting. The door cannot open itself — it must first know what it is. A door without a name is every door and no door.*\n\n*The hum deepens.*\n\n*Name your door.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":187,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}